# EXPECT_COMPILE_ERROR: Class 'Shapeless' declares no constructor; constructors are not inherited
#~
'Shapeless->New()' on a class with no constructor at all resolved to
System.Base's New: it built a Base, which then failed at run time as an
"Invalid object cast: 'System.Base' to 'Shapeless'". A class with no
constructor cannot be instantiated; this is now a compile error.
~#
class Shapeless {
  method : public : Name() ~ String {
    return "shapeless";
  }
}

class BadConstructorMissing {
  function : Make() ~ Shapeless {
    return Shapeless->New();
  }

  function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
    Make()->Name()->PrintLine();
  }
}
